ISO: Fixed `cobbler buildiso --standalone` rejecting the profiles that are assigned to `--distro`. The membership check compared profile names against `Distro.children`, which is derived from `COLLECTION_TYPE` and therefore never yields profiles, so every explicitly requested profile was reported as an orphan. Profiles are now resolved through `profile.distro`, the error message lists the rejected names instead of individual characters, and the loop that filters the selected names no longer removes entries while iterating (which silently dropped selection and emptied the caller's list).
